    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About FireKrackers</h2><br>FireKrackers is an arcade/puzzle game in which Your goal is to destroy all the blocks in the level in shortest time possible. <br><br>Adjacent blocks of the same kind can be chained. To chain Distant blocks, player can use &quot;Chainer&quot; item.<br>There are few kinds of obstacles present to make gameplay a little bit harder :D<br><br>You can earn up to 3 stars for completing a level. For stars You unlock new levels and &quot;weapons&quot; :)<br><br>There isn't too much to say about FK, You just have to play it :D<br><br><br>FK is a solo project of mine, I really hope You enjoy it :)<br>Music created by Serge Quadrado.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About FireKrackers</h2><br>FireKrackers is an arcade/puzzle game in which Your goal is to destroy all the blocks in the level in shortest time possible. <br><br>Adjacent blocks of the same kind can be chained. To chain Distant blocks, player can use &quot;Chainer&quot; item.<br>There are few kinds of obstacles present to make gameplay a little bit harder :D<br><br>You can earn up to 3 stars for completing a level. For stars You unlock new levels and &quot;weapons&quot; :)<br><br>There isn't too much to say about FK, You just have to play it :D<br><br><br>FK is a solo project of mine, I really hope You enjoy it :)<br>Music created by Serge Quadrado.",
